 "notes": "Line numeral in force at top of p. 10 = 7 (last numeral on p. 9). Numerals '10.' (inside usexṭ, after G43) and '15.' (inside seba, after D58) fall inside words; those words assigned to the preceding line. Rubric line on p. 10 l. 8 runs from M17 of ànet' to V31 of ḥrà-k: covers both words fully; a small asterisk sits above the line. Another small asterisk above àn (l. 14). A small raised '1' after ba (p. 10 l. 11) looks like a footnote number but p. 10 has no footnote. p. 10 has no footnotes. p. 11: read down to Ani (l. 20); horizontal rule then 'PLATE III.' heading. [per] in l. 19: hieroglyph line has no brackets/gap, only the grain determinative. maāχeru on p. 10 l. 10 printed without U1."
